    "steam_appid": 2639380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/3e7ec4b9d81ae84674b57fea8311d64f.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>The Neverwhere Tales - Book 1 is a story-driven Adult Visual Novel. The story takes place in an urban fantasy setting and combines a modern world with fantasy elements like magic, magical creatures, and supernatural elements.<br>Book 1 is the story of Alexander Callister (first name can be changed) and how he learns about this hidden world called &quot;Neverwhere.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/997af5f5af9526e9ab30d874aa24bf92.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>You live a normal life. <br>You grew up on the outskirts of the city with parents who were always there for you and your sister. <br>After finishing school, you applied for a normal job. <br>Now you're working your way up the career ladder and living the corporate life. <br>That all changes one day when you get a call from your mother. You learn that all you believed in as true was a facade. <br><br>You're confronted with a world you always thought of as fiction or movie material. <br>How you deal with this new situation, this new world, who you trust or not... that is up to you. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/c850b61e61dffc670a9614998ce1b3e5.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>The early access version already comes with an image gallery, a cinematics gallery, achievement functionality, and a chapter summary at the end summarizing the decisions you made.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/3e7ec4b9d81ae84674b57fea8311d64f.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>The Neverwhere Tales - Book 1 is a story-driven Adult Visual Novel. The story takes place in an urban fantasy setting and combines a modern world with fantasy elements like magic, magical creatures, and supernatural elements.<br>Book 1 is the story of Alexander Callister (first name can be changed) and how he learns about this hidden world called &quot;Neverwhere.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/997af5f5af9526e9ab30d874aa24bf92.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>You live a normal life. <br>You grew up on the outskirts of the city with parents who were always there for you and your sister. <br>After finishing school, you applied for a normal job. <br>Now you're working your way up the career ladder and living the corporate life. <br>That all changes one day when you get a call from your mother. You learn that all you believed in as true was a facade. <br><br>You're confronted with a world you always thought of as fiction or movie material. <br>How you deal with this new situation, this new world, who you trust or not... that is up to you. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/c850b61e61dffc670a9614998ce1b3e5.avif?t=1734557418\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>The early access version already comes with an image gallery, a cinematics gallery, achievement functionality, and a chapter summary at the end summarizing the decisions you made.",
